<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Event Reminder</title>
    <style>
        body {
            font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
            line-height: 1.6;
            color: #333;
            max-width: 600px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            padding: 20px;
        }
        .header {
            background-color: #2196F3;
            color: white;
            padding: 20px;
            text-align: center;
            border-radius: 5px 5px 0 0;
        }
        .content {
            background-color: #f9f9f9;
            padding: 20px;
            border-radius: 0 0 5px 5px;
        }
        .event-details {
            background-color: white;
            padding: 15px;
            margin: 15px 0;
            border-radius: 5px;
            border-left: 4px solid #2196F3;
        }
        .event-title {
            font-size: 18px;
            font-weight: bold;
            color: #1976D2;
            margin-bottom: 10px;
        }
        .event-info {
            margin: 8px 0;
        }
        .event-info strong {
            color: #555;
        }
        .reminder-notice {
            background-color: #E3F2FD;
            padding: 15px;
            margin: 15px 0;
            border-radius: 5px;
            border-left: 4px solid #2196F3;
        }
        .role-badge {
            display: inline-block;
            background-color: #2196F3;
            color: white;
            padding: 5px 10px;
            border-radius: 15px;
            font-size: 12px;
            text-transform: uppercase;
        }
        .footer {
            text-align: center;
            margin-top: 20px;
            padding-top: 20px;
            border-top: 1px solid #ddd;
            color: #666;
            font-size: 12px;
        }
        .button {
            display: inline-block;
            background-color: #2196F3;
            color: white;
            padding: 12px 24px;
            text-decoration: none;
            border-radius: 5px;
            margin: 10px 5px;
        }
        .button:hover {
            background-color: #1976D2;
        }
        .urgent {
            background-color: #FF5722;
            color: white;
        }
        .urgent:hover {
            background-color: #E64A19;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="header">
        <h1>⏰ Event Reminder</h1>
    </div>
    
    <div class="content">
        <p>Hello {{participantName}},</p>
        
        <div class="reminder-notice">
            <h3>🔔 Reminder: Your event starts in {{timeUntilEvent}}</h3>
            <p>Don't forget about your upcoming {{eventType}} event!</p>
        </div>
        
        <div class="event-details">
            <div class="event-title">{{eventTitle}}</div>
            
            <div class="event-info">
                <strong>Start Time:</strong> {{startTime}}
            </div>
            
            <div class="event-info">
                <strong>End Time:</strong> {{endTime}}
            </div>
            
            {{#if location}}
            <div class="event-info">
                <strong>Location:</strong> {{location}}
            </div>
            {{/if}}
            
            <div class="event-info">
                <strong>Your Role:</strong> <span class="role-badge">{{role}}</span>
            </div>
            
            {{#if notes}}
            <div class="event-info">
                <strong>Notes:</strong> {{notes}}
            </div>
            {{/if}}
        </div>
        
        <p>Please make sure you're prepared and ready to join on time. If you need to reschedule or have any questions, please contact the event organizer as soon as possible.</p>
        
        <div style="text-align: center; margin: 20px 0;">
            <a href="{{eventUrl}}" class="button">View Event Details</a>
            {{#if isUrgent}}
            <a href="{{joinUrl}}" class="button urgent">Join Now</a>
            {{/if}}
        </div>
        
        <p>We look forward to seeing you!</p>
        
        <p>Best regards,<br>
        The FConnect Team</p>
    </div>
    
    <div class="footer">
        <p>This is an automated reminder from FConnect. Please do not reply to this email.</p>
        <p>If you have any questions, please contact our support team.</p>
    </div>
</body>
</html> 
